      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T23:14:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC using the dist property in `android.ModuleBase` requires the module to call `ctx.SetOutputFile`, so that the module can specify the dist goal and target using the output file tag. However given that we deliberately want to prevent this module from setting `SetOutputFile` (so that this module cannot be accidentially depended by other modules), utilizing the regular dist property is a bit trickier for this module.",
      "parentUuid": "e06d29fb_f29ed8a8",
      "revId": "927d4008143b7bba9c8a9c069d2e241cec25eb25",
